# Generated for sharing. Rebuilt from its source, never committed.
NW Digital City - Feedback Review.xlsx

# Internal working documents. The repository is handed to whoever deploys it,
# and these three are not theirs to read: the walkthrough script is written to
# be spoken by one person, the review log is a working trail of findings, and
# the design rationale records what was rejected and why. Everything an
# environment owner or a maintainer needs is in the documents that remain.
#
# Untracked from this commit onward rather than purged from history: the
# repository is private, and rewriting history would break the merged pull
# request links for no gain.
#
# tests/test_repository_standard.py still holds these to the writing standard
# when they are present, so an untracked document does not become an unedited
# one. tests/test_docs.py skips the checks that need one that is absent.
docs/PRESENTING.md
docs/REVIEW-LOG.md
docs/DESIGN.md
